# Committed base environment for content, loaded by Task on every invocation.
#
# Per-developer overrides belong in .env.local (gitignored), which WINS over
# this file. A missing .env.local is not an error.
#
# This file holds genuine per-developer PREFERENCES only. The authoritative
# build TARGET lives in Taskfile.yml, not here, so two developers cannot run
# `task verify` against different projects.
#
# THESE FILES MUST BE UTF-8. Task's dotenv parser reads UTF-8 only, and on a
# malformed file its error message ECHOES THE FILE'S CONTENTS -- so a UTF-16
# .env.local leaks any secret it holds to the console and any log. Note Windows
# PowerShell 5.1's `>` and `>>` write UTF-16. See script/README.md.
#
# Do NOT put secrets here.

# Configuration used by build and test.
BRP_DOTNET_CONFIGURATION=Debug
